    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "# DUNCAN PRIME — STUDIO MATHEMATICS / QUALITY RESEARCH\n\nSTATUS = OWNER-DIRECTED / RESEARCH\nBASE_MAIN_AT_START = b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1\nMAIN_MUTATION = NO\nMERGE = NO unless OWNER explicitly authorizes a merge gate\nCANON_LOCK = NO\n\n## OWNER DIRECTION\nMaintain a dedicated mathematics research branch for ZORR. DUNCAN PRIME acts as the researcher of how mathematics improves studio quality, consistency, speed, throughput, reliability, cost efficiency, directing, animation, color, texture, camera, QC and production decision-making.\n\n## RESEARCH OBJECTIVE\nTurn mathematics into practical ZORR production advantage, not disconnected theory.\n\nPrimary domains:\n- pixel geometry / 16:9 canonical frame math;\n- character geometry / landmarks / silhouette / line metrics;\n- color science / palette topology / perceptual color QC;\n- texture / spatial-frequency / sampling / aliasing / temporal texture stability;\n- camera / projection / FOV / scale / framing;\n- motion / timing / trajectories / kinematics;\n- quality statistics / false-pass / false-fail / uncertainty;\n- production graphs / scheduling / bottlenecks / queues / throughput;\n- asset dependency graphs / change-impact radius;\n- GPU/render/generation cost per approved asset;\n- reliability / SLI-SLO / rework / retry mathematics;\n- risk forecasting / Monte Carlo / deadline probability;\n- information gain / reference-sheet value;\n- optimization of shot budget and artist/compute allocation.\n\n## OPERATING LAW\n`DEFINE -> MEASURE -> CALCULATE -> APPLY -> VERIFY -> RECORD`\n\nUse exact units and reproducible measurements. Prefer existing ZORR code, native/standard methods and mature OSS before custom infrastructure. Do not invent thresholds that have not been measured from approved ZORR evidence. Separate STANDARD / SOURCE-DERIVED / PROJECT / DERIVED / UNKNOWN.\n\n## BRANCH INTENT\nLong-lived research branch only. Research documents and bounded measurement/QC helpers may live there. No silent merge to main, no production/canon mutation, no replacement framework for existing ZORR systems.\n\n## INITIAL SEED\nCarry forward the current 16:9 pixel-math handoff and the texture/color mathematics research, then expand into studio-system mathematics.\n\n## TERMINAL STATE FOR EACH RESEARCH SLICE\nA slice may be called PASS only when formulas/sources are fresh-verified and the document clearly distinguishes measured thresholds from unresolved values. Production thresholds remain QC_PENDING until measured on approved ZORR assets.",
